In this work, we study the removability of boundary singular sets for certain classes of quasilinear elliptic equations in domains $Ω$ of an $n$-dimensional Finsler manifold ( $\mathcal{M}, F, \vartheta$ ). We work with Lipschitz functions $ρ_1$ and $ρ_2$ satisfying distance-type properties; in particular, $F(\cdot,  oldsymbol{
